{
  "id": 8834369913031,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Splattered Background Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-splattered-background-blanket-with-name-and-number-688a034f2b-688a034f2b",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in ultimate warmth and show off your love for the game with a personalized touch from Jeminise. This cozy sports-themed blanket features a modern basketball design on a vibrant polka dot and paint-splattered background, making it the perfect addition to any player's or fan's collection. Fully customizable with your choice of name and number, it makes an exceptionally thoughtful and unique gift for birthdays, holidays, or team celebrations.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own Name and Number for a truly unique sports keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from high-quality Fleece or Sherpa fabric to provide super soft, lightweight, and comfortable warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four versatile sizes, including Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor lounging on the sofa, adding a decorative layer to your bed, or taking along on travels, camping trips, and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple maintenance with machine washable fabric; wash separately in cold water and air dry for a quick, fluffy finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Blanket 12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Travel Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Sport Type</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs (Name and Number)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W (Small base size)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
